{"version":1,"content":"<p>英國湖區（Lake District）山地救援人員表示，越來越多年輕人因在山區徒步時依賴手機上的Google地圖導航而迷路或陷入險境。瓦茲代爾山地救援隊（Wasdale Mountain Rescue Team）在周日完成一次全員出動救援後發出警告，稱遇險者中年輕人比例明顯上升，其中大多數年齡在18歲至24歲之間。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587710.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T17:38:29.615158+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T17:12:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T17:31:41.633076+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T17:31:41.633076+00:00","content_hash":"aed4c934bc89190e3c48dc5f8080a28d472b7b3a2d7c86cf9b27e1b21b45a206","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}